    "searchText": "Question 3\nQUESTION\nThe following events took place in March 20X4. Which of these is an example of an adjusting \nsubsequent event for the YE 31 December 20X3?\nA) A merger with a major competitor\nB) A flood in the entity’s warehouse destroyed 20% of inventory\nC) A trade receivable which had been experiencing financial difficulty went into liquidation\nD) All of the above\n \nICAS AA Workshop 4\n11\n",
