    "searchText": "Question 4\nQUESTION\nWhich of the following statements regarding subsequent events is true?\nA) The auditor must obtain sufficient appropriate evidence on whether events occurring between \nthe date of the financial statements and the date of the auditor’s report require adjustment in the \nfinancial statements, and are appropriately reflected\nB) After the date of the audit report, the auditor must perform audit procedures on all events \nwhich arise to obtain sufficient appropriate evidence that these are appropriately adjusted in the \nfinancial statements\nC) Both of these are true\n \nICAS AA Workshop 4\n13\n",
